        {
            "content": "To answer this question, let’s first review Earth's four spheres:\n\n* The atmosphere is all the gases in the air that surround Earth;\n* The biosphere is all living organisms;\n* The geosphere is the interior and surface of the Earth, including rocks, continents, and the ocean floor;\n* The hydrosphere is all saltwater, freshwater (including precipitation), underground water, and ice.",
